OL,3,GNEWSADrug addict who murdered man in
OL,4,Ahis own home jailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug addict who murdered a man in his
OL,7,Fown home in North Ayrshire has been
OL,8,Fjailed for life.
OL,10,FTerrence Welsh, 42, stabbed 59-year-old
OL,11,FStuart Kennedy in the chest as he sat
OL,12,Fin a chair at his flat in Ardrossan.
OL,14,FThe men had been in the house with
OL,15,FKennedy's daughter and another woman
OL,16,Fbefore a row broke out.
OL,18,FKennedy's daughter left the flat and
OL,19,Fwhen she returned later, Welsh told
OL,20,Fher: "Your dad is dead. I have murdered
OL,21,Fhim."
